  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Three days after wills wake in Heavenly Court, four rank eight Gu Immortals appear in the air above Hairy Foot Mountain in Central Continent and conceal their auras. She is the only female immortal among the four. She starts the opening: she stretches out her hands and white fog rises in the surroundings. After six rounds of attacks the mountain disappears and Infallible blessed land opens. She takes out a handkerchief, wipes the sweat on her forehead, and asks Lian Jiu Sheng why they cannot completely take down the blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        845
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_hairy_foot_mountain",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "loc_infallible_blessed_land",
        "char_lian_jiu_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is the only female immortal among the four Heavenly Court Gu Immortals at Hairy Foot Mountain. She takes out a handkerchief and wipes the sweat on her forehead.",
      "chapters": [
        845
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At the source of Falling Heavenly River a vast rank eight aura surges and a female immortal descends. She is named the rank eight water path Gu Immortal Bai Cang Shui.",
      "chapters": [
        960
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "water-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_falling_heavenly_river"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When one of immortal zombie Bo Qing’s sword lights cuts through Heaven Overseeing Tower, Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord recalls her along with Lian Jiu Sheng and Bi Chen Tian; the four confer, and she alone is sent to search the riverbed of Falling Heavenly River while the other three stay behind to mend the tower.",
      "chapters": [
        996
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "falling-heavenly-river-search",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bo_qing",
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower",
        "char_heaven_overseeing_tower_lord",
        "char_bi_chen_tian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Of the many Gu Immortals whose corpses lie in that riverbed, she is the only one who survives.",
      "chapters": [
        997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "falling-heavenly-river-search",
